 "details": {
  "title": "Fauré – Après un rêve, in A minor",
  "lead": "Fauré’s line for the trumpet a minor third under his C minor, in A minor (B minor for the trumpet), concert A3 to D5, on the bars of the Fret Finder guitar arrangement in the same key, an octave above where the baritone sings it. It plays in that guitar track’s time, about 54. Breaths come at the ends of the poem’s lines; the dynamics are Fauré’s. The lead sheet in Fauré’s C minor stays as it is.",
